        "label": "A",
        "question": "(i) Which fuel type provided the highest percentage of Ireland's energy in 2017?\n(ii) What percentage of primary energy was provided by renewables in 2017?\n(iii) Calculate the percentage of primary energy provided by oil, gas and coal combined in 2017.\n(iv) Name two examples of renewable energy.\n(v) Explain briefly one advantage of renewable energy.\n(vi) Explain briefly one disadvantage of renewable energy.",
        "marks": 30,
