        "question": "Examine the 1:50 000 Ordnance Survey map and legend accompanying this paper. Draw a sketch map of the area shown to half scale. On it, correctly show and label each of the following: The entire area of Lisnananagh Lough, The course of the Stradone River from where it exits Lisnananagh Lough to H 505 056, The triangulation pillar at Fleming's Folly in the south west of the map, The entire area of land above 300 metres.",
