        "model": "One primary economic activity in West Africa (Ghana): **Cocoa production and export**.\n\nGhana is the world's second-largest cocoa producer (after Ivory Coast), producing approximately 15%+ of global cocoa. Cocoa is Ghana's largest agricultural export and a crucial foreign exchange earner.",
