        "label": "7A",
        "question": "Examine the aerial photograph of Cavan accompanying this paper. Draw a sketch map of the area shown on the aerial photograph. On it, show and label each of the following: A lake, A church, An area of waste ground in the centre foreground, A car park, Two connecting streets.",
        "marks": 30,
