        "label": "5A",
        "question": "Examine the chart above showing the average size of Irish farms in hectares (ha) in 2023 and answer each of the following questions.\n(i) Which farm type had the smallest average farm size?\n(ii) What was the average size (in hectares) of tillage farms?\n(iii) Calculate the difference (in hectares) between the average dairy farm size and the average sheep farm size.\n(iv) State two products made from the output of a dairy farm.\n(v) Briefly explain the importance of farming to the Irish economy.",
